    <string name="settings_history_title">Price history</string>
    <string name="settings_history_enable">Record the price history</string>
    <string name="settings_history_help">Keeps on the phone, for every station, each price change seen in the downloaded data. Reliable tracking therefore depends on regular downloads of the data, see the \"Background refresh\" section below. Whatever happens, all the data stays on the phone: nothing is downloaded from any server other than the government\'s, and nothing is sent to any server. This option is off by default.</string>
